  <h2>6. Strategic Recommendations</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Actionable pricing and positioning recommendations grounded in the data.</p>

  <div class="recommendation">
    <strong>1. Prioritize the $6–$12 Price Window for New Releases</strong>
